  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"assets/logo.svg\" width=\"72\" height=\"72\" alt=\"DSH Side Chat\" />"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Side Chat",
      "text": "<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/qiaozheng9/dsh-side-chat/releases/latest\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/qiaozheng9/dsh-side-chat?style=flat-square&amp;color=4d6bfe\" width=\"94\" height=\"20\" alt=\"Latest release\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#安装\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DSH-0.2.1--rc.5-4d6bfe?style=flat-square\" width=\"108\" height=\"20\" alt=\"DSH 0.2.1-rc.5\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#安装\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Windows-Desktop-0078d4?style=flat-square\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" alt=\"Windows Desktop\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/qiaozheng9/dsh-side-chat?style=flat-square\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" alt=\"MIT License\" /></a>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Side Chat",
      "text": "**简体中文** · [English](README.en.md)\n\n[功能](#功能) · [安装](#安装) · [使用](#使用) · [常见问题](#常见问题) · [更新记录](CHANGELOG.md)\n\n</div>\n\n主对话正在实现功能，你想先弄清一个技术选择、检查一段代码，或者讨论另一种方案？在主对话输入 `/side`，就能在右侧打开一个带有当前上下文的独立对话。\n\n侧边对话有自己的消息、模型和权限。你可以继续追问、添加文件、制定计划，也可以同时打开多个侧边对话。\n\n**保留上下文，打开时不显示旧记录。** 侧边只显示打开后新增的问答；模型仍可使用打开时的主对话上下文。消息时间、token 用量、流式回复、输入框和加号菜单继续复用 DSH 原生组件。\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/overview.svg\" width=\"960\" alt=\"工作方式示意：主对话继续推进任务，打开时的上下文传递给独立侧边对话，用于解释、核对和讨论。\" />\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "| 功能 | 你可以做什么 |\n| --- | --- |\n| **带上下文的追问** | 打开时界面为空，模型保留主对话上下文；也可选中文字，直接在侧边询问。 |\n| **独立的模型与权限** | 使用 DSH 原生选择器切换模型、推理等级和权限，设置仅作用于当前侧边对话。 |\n| **原生附件与引用** | 沿用主对话的文件、图片和 `@` 引用能力，为当前副本添加参考材料。 |\n| **目标与计划** | 创建、编辑、暂停或继续目标；进入计划模式，在侧边审核模型提交的计划。 |\n| **多标签对话** | 同时保留多个侧边讨论，分别处理不同问题。 |\n| **临时会话不占列表** | 侧边临时对话不进入左侧会话列表，也不会出现在列表搜索结果中。 |\n| **时间、用量与导出** | 查看原生消息时间、token 用量和执行过程，使用原生压缩与日志下载。 |\n| **关闭后清理** | 没发过消息时直接清理；开始聊天后再确认删除。清理会话文件、索引、缓存、草稿和独占附件。 |"
    },
    {
      "section": "熟悉的 DSH 操作",
      "text": "侧边初始页显示 DSH 原生标志和上下文提示；发送第一条消息后，进入正常聊天界面。\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/screenshots/empty-chat.png\" width=\"560\" alt=\"侧边初始页：DeepSeek 原生标志、上下文提示与原生输入框。\" />\n</p>\n\n聊天内容和输入框直接使用 DSH 原生组件。点击 **＋**，与主对话相同的文件、目标、计划、反馈、压缩、权限、模型和日志下载都在这里；具体项目随 DSH 原生功能而定。\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/screenshots/native-chat.png\" width=\"560\" alt=\"真实 DSH 验证会话：原生消息时间、token 用量、消息操作与输入框。\" />\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "熟悉的 DSH 操作",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/screenshots/side-menu.png\" width=\"560\" alt=\"侧边加号菜单：原生图标、命令别名和右侧说明。\" />\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "计划在侧边审核，关闭前明确确认",
      "text": "<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td width=\"56%\" valign=\"top\">\n      <strong>计划审核</strong><br /><br />\n      查看模型提交的计划，选择批准，或补充意见继续规划。<br /><br />\n      <img src=\"assets/screenshots/plan-review.png\" width=\"420\" alt=\"侧边对话中的计划审核面板。\" />\n    </td>\n    <td width=\"44%\" valign=\"top\">\n      <strong>临时对话清理</strong><br /><br />\n      已开始聊天时确认删除；未发消息的侧边直接清理。删除失败时保留并允许重试。<br /><br />\n      <img src=\"assets/screenshots/close-dialog.png\" width=\"330\" alt=\"关闭侧边对话前的删除确认弹窗。\" />\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "> [!IMPORTANT]\n> 当前完整支持 **Windows · DSH Desktop `0.2.1-rc.5`**。请先按 [dsh-delete-session 的安装说明](https://github.com/qiaozheng9/dsh-delete-session#安装)安装并启用删除服务，再安装本插件。该服务负责关闭后的永久清理，安装过程包含它所需的桌面程序适配。\n\n在 PowerShell 中执行：\n\n```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add https://github.com/qiaozheng9/dsh-side-chat/releases/download/v0.2.4/dsh-side-chat-0.2.4.tgz\n```\n\n**重启 DSH，在已有聊天内容的主对话输入 `/side`。** 全新且未聊天的主对话不提供此命令。发行包已预构建，无需在本机编译。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "如果已启用其他插件的 `/side` 功能，请先停用同名入口，避免命令冲突。其他 DSH 版本、独立 Web 部署及其他操作系统尚未完成端到端验证。"
    },
    {
      "section": "1. 打开侧边对话",
      "text": "在**主对话输入框**输入：\n\n```text\n/side\n```\n\n也可以直接带上问题：\n\n```text\n/side 解释一下刚才这个方案的取舍，还有哪些替代方案？\n```\n\n选中主对话中的一段文字，点击 **「在侧边对话中询问」**，即可围绕选中的内容继续讨论。"
    },
    {
      "section": "2. 按当前问题选择工具",
      "text": "- 点击输入框下方的模型或权限控件，设置当前侧边对话。\n- 点击 **＋ → 文件**，添加文件或图片；其他引用沿用主对话的 `@` 入口。\n- 点击 **＋ → 目标** 管理长期目标，或通过 **＋ → 计划** 进入、退出计划模式。\n- 点击侧边顶部的 **＋**，再开一个独立讨论。"
    },
    {
      "section": "3. 保留结果，再关闭",
      "text": "需要留存时，先点击 **＋ → 下载日志**。没有发送过新消息的侧边对话会直接关闭并清理，包括只输入了草稿的情况。已开始聊天时，选择 **「删除并关闭」** 会停止侧边活动并清理数据；选择取消则继续保留。\n\n临时对话不会加入左侧列表。窗口刷新或 DSH 重启后，插件会通过已登记的临时身份回收遗留副本，避免留下找不到入口的会话。"
    },
    {
      "section": "常见问题",
      "text": "<details>\n<summary><strong>会改变主对话或其他侧边对话吗？</strong></summary>\n\n侧边使用新的会话 ID，消息、目标、计划和权限绑定当前副本，已打开主对话的内容和选择不会被切换。复制的是打开时的历史与上下文，包括此前仍适用的用户指令；不额外注入“侧边对话”模式。原生控件的偏好保存规则与 DSH 本身一致。\n\n界面只显示打开后新增的消息，聊天导航与轨迹也遵循这个显示起点。继承的记录仍保留在临时副本中，供模型使用；打开后主对话新增的内容不会自动同步进来。\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>为什么关闭时提示删除失败？</strong></summary>\n\n请确认 [dsh-delete-session](https://github.com/qiaozheng9/dsh-delete-session#安装) 已按其文档完成安装，并在同一个 `desktop` profile 中启用。删除没有成功时，面板会保留，方便处理后重试。\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "常见问题",
      "text": "<details>\n<summary><strong>下载的日志包含哪些内容？</strong></summary>\n\n使用 DSH 原生的日志导出，范围是当前副本，包含复制进来的主对话历史；不会导出其他独立侧边的后续消息。分享前请自行检查内容。\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>关闭会删除我添加的项目文件吗？</strong></summary>\n\n会话清理会保留你引用的项目文件和共享数据，清理的是该侧边对话的消息及相关独占数据。确认删除后，对话内容无法通过本插件恢复。\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>可以从 npm 或 GitHub 源码直接安装吗？</strong></summary>\n\n目前请使用上方的 **GitHub Release 预构建包**。主分支存放开发源码，直接安装 GitHub 主分支不会自动生成运行文件。自行构建的步骤见 [开发文档](docs/development.md)。\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "反馈与贡献",
      "text": "遇到问题时，请在 [Issues](https://github.com/qiaozheng9/dsh-side-chat/issues) 提供 DSH 版本、插件版本、复现步骤及相关截图；日志请先确认不含敏感内容。\n\n欢迎提交改进。[开发文档](docs/development.md)包含构建、验证与代码入口，[更新记录](CHANGELOG.md)列出各版本变化。"
    },
    {
      "section": "致谢与许可",
      "text": "侧边对话核心提取自 [Better Sidebar](https://github.com/omdsh-dev/DSH-better-sidebar)，交互参考 Codex `/side`。感谢上游项目。\n\n[MIT License](LICENSE) · [来源与版权说明](NOTICE.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img src=\"assets/logo.svg\" width=\"72\" height=\"72\" alt=\"DSH Side Chat\" />"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Side Chat",
      "text": "**Keep the main task moving. Ask a follow-up on the side.**\n\nCodex-style `/side` conversations for DeepSeek Harness."
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Side Chat",
      "text": "<p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/qiaozheng9/dsh-side-chat/releases/latest\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/qiaozheng9/dsh-side-chat?style=flat-square&amp;color=4d6bfe\" width=\"94\" height=\"20\" alt=\"Latest release\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#install\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DSH-0.2.1--rc.5-4d6bfe?style=flat-square\" width=\"108\" height=\"20\" alt=\"DSH 0.2.1-rc.5\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"#install\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Windows-Desktop-0078d4?style=flat-square\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" alt=\"Windows Desktop\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/qiaozheng9/dsh-side-chat?style=flat-square\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" alt=\"MIT License\" /></a>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Side Chat",
      "text": "[简体中文](README.md) · **English**\n\n[Features](#features) · [Install](#install) · [Usage](#usage) · [FAQ](#faq) · [Changelog](CHANGELOG.md)\n\n</div>\n\nYour main chat is implementing a feature, but you want to understand a design choice, inspect some code, or explore another approach. Enter `/side` to open an independent conversation beside it, with the context captured when it opens."
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Side Chat",
      "text": "Each side chat has its own messages, model and permissions. Attach reference files, discuss a plan, or keep several side conversations open at once.\n\nTemporary side chats stay out of the left conversation list and its search results. Confirmed close removes their session files, indexes, caches, drafts and exclusive attachments. Referenced project files and shared data remain intact. Registered abandoned copies are reclaimed after a window reload or DSH restart."
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Side Chat",
      "text": "**A clean transcript with the context preserved.** Side chats display only messages added after opening, while the model retains the main chat's context at that point. Timestamps, token usage, streaming, the composer and command menus continue to use DSH's native components."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "| Feature | What you can do |\n| --- | --- |\n| **Contextual follow-ups** | Open with an empty transcript and the main chat's context, or select a passage to ask about it. |\n| **Independent models and permissions** | Use native DSH controls to choose the model, reasoning effort and permission preset for this side chat. |\n| **Native attachments and references** | Use the same file, image and `@` reference features as the main chat. |\n| **Goals and plans** | Create, edit, pause and resume goals; enter plan mode and review the submitted plan in the side panel. |\n| **Multiple tabs** | Keep separate discussions open for different questions. |\n| **Timestamps, usage and export** | See native message times, token usage and execution details; use native compaction and log export. |\n| **Temporary conversations** | Confirm before permanently deleting a side chat. Download its logs first if you want to keep a copy. |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Native DSH controls",
      "text": "The transcript and composer use the actual native components. The **＋** menu follows the main chat, including files, goals, plans, feedback, compaction, permissions, models and log export, as provided by your DSH installation.\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/screenshots/native-chat.png\" width=\"560\" alt=\"Actual native DSH verification chat with timestamps, token usage and message actions; interface shown in Chinese.\" />\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Native DSH controls",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"assets/screenshots/side-menu.png\" width=\"560\" alt=\"Side-chat menu with native icons and descriptions; interface shown in Chinese.\" />\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Native DSH controls",
      "text": "<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td width=\"56%\" valign=\"top\">\n      <strong>Review plans in context</strong><br /><br />\n      Read the proposed plan, approve it, or leave feedback and keep planning.<br /><br />\n      <img src=\"assets/screenshots/plan-review.png\" width=\"420\" alt=\"Plan review in the side chat; interface shown in Chinese.\" />\n    </td>\n    <td width=\"44%\" valign=\"top\">\n      <strong>Confirm before cleanup</strong><br /><br />\n      Cancel to keep the conversation. Failed deletion retains the panel so you can retry.<br /><br />\n      <img src=\"assets/screenshots/close-dialog.png\" width=\"330\" alt=\"Permanent-deletion confirmation; interface shown in Chinese.\" />\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "> [!IMPORTANT]\n> The complete supported setup is **Windows · DSH Desktop `0.2.1-rc.5`**. First install and enable [dsh-delete-session](https://github.com/qiaozheng9/dsh-delete-session#安装) using its documented setup, including the required Desktop application adaptation. It provides permanent cleanup when a side chat closes.\n\nRun in PowerShell:\n\n```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add https://github.com/qiaozheng9/dsh-side-chat/releases/download/v0.2.4/dsh-side-chat-0.2.4.tgz\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "**Restart DSH, then enter `/side` in a main chat with existing messages.** The command is unavailable in a fresh empty conversation. This prebuilt package requires no local compilation.\n\nDisable another `/side` provider before enabling this one. Other DSH versions, standalone Web deployments and operating systems have not completed end-to-end validation."
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage",
      "text": "Enter either command in the **main chat composer**:\n\n```text\n/side\n```\n\n```text\n/side Explain the tradeoffs in that approach. What alternatives should I consider?\n```\n\nYou can also select text in the main transcript and choose **Ask in side chat**."
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage",
      "text": "- Use the model and permission controls beneath the side-chat input to configure that conversation.\n- Use **＋ → File** to attach files or images, and the native `@` entry point for references.\n- Use **＋ → Goal** to manage a goal, or **＋ → Plan** to enter or leave plan mode.\n- Use **＋** in the side-panel header to start another side chat.\n- Use **＋ → Download logs** before closing if you want to retain the results."
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage",
      "text": "The empty side page shows DSH’s native brand mark and a context hint. A side chat with no new messages closes and cleans up directly, including draft-only input. After a message is sent, **Delete and close** confirms permanent cleanup; cancelling keeps it open."
    },
    {
      "section": "FAQ",
      "text": "**Does this change the main chat?** The copy has a new Session ID and its own messages, goals, plans and permissions. The open main chat's content and selections remain independent. The fork inherits the existing history and applicable user instructions, without an extra side-chat boundary prompt. Native preference-saving rules follow DSH itself."
    },
    {
      "section": "FAQ",
      "text": "**Why does closing fail?** Check that dsh-delete-session is installed and enabled in the same `desktop` profile. Failed cleanup keeps the panel open for retry.\n\n**What is exported?** Native DSH export targets this copy, including its inherited main-chat history. Other independent side chats' subsequent messages are excluded. Inspect the contents before sharing."
    },
    {
      "section": "FAQ",
      "text": "**Are my project files deleted?** Referenced project files and shared data are retained. Cleanup removes the side conversation and its exclusively owned data.\n\n**Can I install from npm or the GitHub main branch?** Use the prebuilt GitHub Release above. The main branch contains development source and does not automatically build runtime files during installation. See the [development guide](docs/development.md) to build locally."
    },
    {
      "section": "Feedback and contributions",
      "text": "[Open an issue](https://github.com/qiaozheng9/dsh-side-chat/issues) with the DSH and plugin versions, reproduction steps and relevant screenshots. Check logs for sensitive information before sharing them.\n\nSee the [development guide](docs/development.md) for build and validation commands, and the [changelog](CHANGELOG.md) for release history."
    },
    {
      "section": "Credits and license",
      "text": "The side-conversation core was extracted from [Better Sidebar](https://github.com/omdsh-dev/DSH-better-sidebar). The interaction is inspired by Codex `/side`.\n\n[MIT License](LICENSE) · [Attribution](NOTICE.md)"
    }
  ],
